    "detailed_description": "Gorb's family has a <strong>special destiny</strong>. When his mom catches him recording an embarrassing <strong>dance tutorial</strong>, she knows that he is ready. She hands him a <strong>magic ribbon</strong> that can open <strong>portals</strong> and sends him to space. He must now travel through the galaxy and defeat his opponents... in epic <strong>DANCE BATTLES</strong>!<br><br>Portal to the Cosmobeat is a <strong>narrative-driven Dance Game</strong> featuring <strong>unconventional movement controls</strong>.<br>Use the keys on your keyboard to select a limb of your choice and now... move your mouse to dance. Sounds easy to you? Prove it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/3b7177d085e85dd074952c13fba3295d.avif?t=1755169554\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/2a352287431433a1db67c41a50fa7243.poster.avif?t=1755169554\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/2a352287431433a1db67c41a50fa7243.webm?t=1755169554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/2a352287431433a1db67c41a50fa7243.mp4?t=1755169554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open portals with your magic ribbon and travel through the galaxy.<br>You will <strong>challenge</strong> the best <strong>dancers</strong> in the universe while listening to the <strong>freshest beats</strong>!<br></li><li>Currently, the game contains one <strong>Level</strong> (aside from our immersive tutorial), featuring<strong> two unique Techno-inspired tracks</strong>, which are gonna get stuck in your head.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/75ffc49c131f043932235a64aea69184.avif?t=1755169554\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/61bce08c7cae0469fc575148515b8c4e.poster.avif?t=1755169554\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/61bce08c7cae0469fc575148515b8c4e.webm?t=1755169554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/61bce08c7cae0469fc575148515b8c4e.mp4?t=1755169554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Follow Gorb on his <strong>quest</strong> through the galaxy with hilarious <strong>dialogue</strong> and engaging <strong>cutscenes</strong>.<br></li><li>Expect the unexpected, when Gorb bravely challenges Techno DJ <strong>Ring</strong> to a dance battle and stay tuned for <strong>future opponents</strong>!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/361d0448ba8dfddeca463a62c3c85d31.avif?t=1755169554\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/a565c781f364be0f246ac1d8418255ed.poster.avif?t=1755169554\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/a565c781f364be0f246ac1d8418255ed.webm?t=1755169554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/a565c781f364be0f246ac1d8418255ed.mp4?t=1755169554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use our game's <strong>unique mechanic</strong> and dance Gorb to the top!<br></li><li>Enjoy Gorb's clumsy dance moves with more than 3 unique <strong>choreographies</strong> and <strong>freestyle</strong> sections.<br></li><li>Reach a new <strong>highscore</strong> and achieve <strong>GORBLIKE</strong> ratings!</li></ul>",
